            <div xml:id="d56">

                <pb facs="0196" n="98" xml:id="pg98"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">393.11/1088: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Minister in
                        China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Johnson</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1930-03-26T13:00:00-05:00">March 26, 1930—1
                    p.m.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>108. Your 219, March 25, 6p.m.</p>
                <p>1. Suggestion in Legation’s 190, March 12, 11 a.m., paragraph 3, was communicated
                    to Catholic authorities, and you are confidentially informed that the latter
                    state they are taking measures toward complying with the suggestion.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Cotton</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
